answer.worked:
Co-interior angles on parallel lines sum to $180^{\circ}$.

$$\begin{align*}
4x+2x&=180\\
6x&=180\\
x&=30^{\circ}
\end{align*}$$

The marked angle $y$ equals the bottom-right angle (alternate angles on parallel lines).

$$\begin{align*}
y&=x+12\\
y&=30+12\\
y&=42^{\circ}
\end{align*}$$

